    "deity": {
      "word": "DEITY",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "The collection of attributes which make up the nature of a god; divinity; godhead; as, the deity of the Supreme Being is seen in his works. They declared with emphasis the perfect deity and the perfect manhood of Christ. Milman.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "A god or goddess; a heathen god. To worship calves, the deities Of Egypt. Milton. The Deity, God, the Supreme Being. This great poet and philosopher [Simonides], the more he contemplated the nature of the Deity, found that he waded but the more out of his depth. Addison.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        }
      ],
